{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.per_nucleon_shift_additive_linearity","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.per_nucleon_shift_additive_linearity","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Int.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.per_nucleon_shift_closed_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.per_nucleon_shift_closed_form","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/per_nucleon_shift_additive_linearity.lean#L82-L109","doc":"**Closed form** for the shift exponent in canonical pppnnn ordering\n([`prop:per-nucleon-shift-additive-linearity`]).  Manuscript boxed\nidentity: `shift(Z, N) = 18Z + 21N + 1` for `Z, N ≥ 1`.\n\n**Derived** by induction: the `N = 1` row from `per_nucleon_shift_row1`,\nthen induction on `N` using the neutron-step increment.  This is a\ngenuine recurrence-to-closed-form derivation, not a projection. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.per_nucleon_shift_row1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.per_nucleon_shift_row1","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/per_nucleon_shift_additive_linearity.lean#L62-L80","doc":"Auxiliary: closed form along the `N = 1` row, derived by induction on\n`Z ≥ 1` from the base case and the proton-step increment. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.per_nucleon_shift_additive_linearity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.per_nucleon_shift_additive_linearity","kind":"theorem","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/per_nucleon_shift_additive_linearity.lean#L50-L60","doc":"**Per-nucleon shift additive linearity**\n([`prop:per-nucleon-shift-additive-linearity`]).\n\nRestates the two constant increments — this is the input recurrence\nitself, exposed as the named theorem. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:per-nucleon-shift-additive-linearity","label":"prop:per-nucleon-shift-additive-linearity","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/per-nucleon-shift-additive-linearity.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PerNucleonShiftContext.shift_neutron_step","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PerNucleonShiftContext.shift_neutron_step","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/per_nucleon_shift_additive_linearity.lean#L47-L47","doc":"Input — per-new-neutron increment is constantly `21` for `Z, N ≥ 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PerNucleonShiftContext.shift_proton_step","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PerNucleonShiftContext.shift_proton_step","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/per_nucleon_shift_additive_linearity.lean#L44-L44","doc":"Input — per-new-proton increment is constantly `18` for `Z, N ≥ 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PerNucleonShiftContext.shift_base","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PerNucleonShiftContext.shift_base","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/per_nucleon_shift_additive_linearity.lean#L42-L42","doc":"Input — base case: `shift(1, 1) = 40` (Hoefsmit deuteron pole order). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PerNucleonShiftContext.shift","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PerNucleonShiftContext.shift","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/per_nucleon_shift_additive_linearity.lean#L40-L40","doc":"The shift exponent `shift(Z, N) : ℤ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PerNucleonShiftContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PerNucleonShiftContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/per_nucleon_shift_additive_linearity.lean#L38-L38","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PerNucleonShiftContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PerNucleonShiftContext","kind":"class","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/per_nucleon_shift_additive_linearity.lean#L34-L48","doc":"Context carrying the *inputs* of the shift recurrence: the base value\n`shift(1,1) = 40` and the constant per-direction increments `18`\n(per new proton) and `21` (per new neutron), valid for `Z, N ≥ 1`.\nThe closed form is NOT a field — it is derived below. ","signatureChunk":0}]}